                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;zfs commit zfs-2.3.99-340-g734eba251&lt;br/&gt;
  Wire O_DIRECT also to Uncached I/O (#17218)&lt;br/&gt;
dmu_write_by_dnode() now has flags argument&lt;br/&gt;
dmu_assign_arcbuf_by_dbuf() now has flags argument&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;zfs commit zfs-2.3.99-373-gac2e57952&lt;br/&gt;
  dmu_tx: make DMU_TX_* flags an enum&lt;br/&gt;
DMU_TX_WAIT may be an enum&lt;/p&gt;</description>
